# Stock Market Performance Dashboard

An interactive Power BI dashboard designed to analyze **S&P 500 stock market performance** from **2014 to 2017**. The dashboard provides insights into stock prices, returns, trading volume, volatility, market trends, and individual stock performance.

## Project Overview

This project transforms historical S&P 500 stock market data into an interactive and visually informative dashboard.

The dashboard helps users analyze overall market performance and perform detailed analysis of individual stocks. Interactive filters allow users to explore data based on **Stock, Year, Month, and Day Type**.

## Dashboard Sections

### 1. Market Performance Overview

Provides an overall view of the stock market.

Key insights include:

- Total Stocks Tracked
- Total Trading Volume
- Average Return Percentage
- Total Gainers and Losers
- Monthly Return Heatmap
- Up vs Down Days
- Top 5 Gainers
- Top 5 Losers
- Total Volume by Year

![Market Performance Overview](sd1.png)

---

### 2. Stock Performance

Provides detailed comparison of stock performance.

Key insights include:

- Selected Stock
- Stock Rank
- Average Stock Performance
- Maximum Stock Performance
- Volatility
- Average Close Price
- Average Daily Return by Month
- Stock Rankings by Average Return
- Total Volume by Year

![Stock Performance](sd2.png)

---

### 3. Risk & Trading Analysis

Focuses on stock volatility and trading activity.

Key insights include:

- Average Daily Range Percentage
- Maximum Daily Range Percentage
- Maximum Return Percentage
- Average Trading Volume
- Total Trading Days
- Top 10 Most Volatile Stocks
- Top 10 Most Traded Stocks
- Volume Concentration
- Average Daily Range by Year
- Volatility by Month

![Risk and Trading Analysis](sd4.png)

---

### 4. Stock Deep Dive

Provides detailed analysis of individual stock performance.

Key insights include:

- Selected Stock
- Stock Rank
- Average Closing Price
- Maximum High Price
- Minimum Low Price
- Average Close vs 7-Day Moving Average
- Up vs Down Days
- Highest vs Lowest Price by Year
- Average Daily Volume by Month
- Average Daily Range by Quarter

![Stock Deep Dive](sd3.png)

