- Dashboard Design

---

## Project Objective

The main objective of this project is to convert raw stock market data into meaningful insights through interactive data visualization.

The dashboard helps users analyze market trends, compare stock performance, identify top gainers and losers, evaluate trading activity, and understand stock volatility.

---

## Conclusion

The Stock Market Performance Dashboard provides a comprehensive analysis of historical stock market data.

By combining interactive filters, KPI cards, charts, heatmaps, tables, and other visualizations, the dashboard makes complex financial data easier to understand and analyze.

